00:20:15,900 --> 00:20:18,300
 Did you hear that?

355
00:20:18,300 --> 00:20:23,040
 I don't think you did, 'cause it was really quiet.

356
00:20:23,980 --> 00:20:28,980
 Like your maker, your creator, the one who formed you

